\f0\fs24 \cf0 =========================================\
      PICO BUILD & FLASH PROCESS\
=========================================\
\
1. PREPARE THE BLUEPRINTS (Run from project root folder)\
   cmake -S . -B build\
\
2. COMPILE THE CODE\
   cmake --build build\
\
3. FLASH THE PICO (Run in order)\
   a. Force Pico into Bootloader Mode:\
      picotool reboot -f -u\
      \
   b. Load and Flash the Binary:\
      picotool load -f build/src/hello_freertos.elf\
      \
   c. Reboot Pico into Normal App Mode to Run:\
      picotool reboot -f\
\
